{'symbol': 'EFX', 'date': '2022-02-07 16:15:00', 'title': 'EQUIFAX COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF EFFICIENT HIRE', 'text': 'ATLANTA, FEB. 7, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0 EQUIFAX ® (NYSE: EFX) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF EFFICIENT HIRE, A PROVIDER OF CLOUD RECRUITING, ONBOARDING AND HR MANAGEMENT SOLUTIONS. THE DEFINITIVE AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE EFFICIENT HIRE WAS ANNOUNCED ON JANUARY 31, 2022.'}